  "zh": "# 今日AI突破频发，折叠屏价格战升级，多国联合声明与中东冲突引关注\n## AI 与科技\n- **OpenAI攻克千禧年难题**：OpenAI宣称解决数学史上悬而未决的千禧年问题，标志着AI在基础科学上的重大进展。\n- **GPT Images2.5发布**：GPT Images2.5升级生成质量与速度，进一步巩固OpenAI在多模态领域的领先地位。\n- **AlphaGenome DNA图谱**：DeepMind发布的人类DNA高分辨率图谱为基因研究与医学提供了前所未有的数据资源。\n## 行业动向\n- **华为小米折叠屏手机售价2万元**：华为与小米率先将折叠屏手机价格拉到2万元，预示着高端折叠市场进入价格竞争新阶段。\n- **年内233家农商村镇银行退出**：一年内超过两百家农商及村镇银行退出，反映地方金融机构整合加速及抗风险压力增大。\n- **浙江公司获美3.66亿关税退税**：浙江一公司成功获得美国3.66亿元关税退税，显示中美经贸摩擦中企业利用政策红利的实际案例。\n## 国际视野\n- **英法等12国发表联合声明**：英法领导的十二国联合声明呼吁加强对全球安全挑战的协同应对，凸显西方在多边事务中的协调意图。\n- **伊朗打击约旦美军基地**：伊朗对约旦美军基地的打击升级中东局势，引发国社会对地区冲突扩散的担忧。",
  "en": "# AI sees major breakthroughs, foldable phone price war intensifies, while joint Western statements and Middle East clashes draw attention\n## AI & Tech\n- **OpenAI solves millennium problem**：OpenAI claims to have solved a long-standing mathematical challenge, marking a major advance for AI in fundamental science.\n- **GPT Images2.5 released**：GPT Images2.5 upgrade improves generation quality and speed, further strengthening OpenAI’s lead in multimodal AI.\n- **AlphaGenome DNA atlas**：DeepMind releases a high‑resolution map of human DNA, providing unprecedented resources for genetics and medicine.\n## Industry Trends\n- **Huawei Xiaomi foldable phones at 20k yuan**：Huawei and Xiaomi push foldable smartphone prices to 20,000 yuan, signaling a price‑war phase in the premium foldable market.\n- **233 rural banks exit in a year**：Over 233 rural commercial and village banks have exited within a year, reflecting accelerated consolidation and rising pressure on local financial institutions.\n- **Zhejiang firm receives $3.66 bn US tax rebate**：A Zhejiang company secures a $3.66 billion US tariff rebate, showing how firms leverage policy gains amid Sino‑US trade tensions.\n## International\n- **UK France lead 12‑nation joint statement**：The UK and France lead a twelve‑nation joint statement urging coordinated response to global security challenges, highlighting Western multilateral alignment.\n- **Iran strikes US base in Jordan**：Iran’s attack on a US military base in Jordan escalates Middle East tensions, raising fears of broader regional conflict."
